# Pairs with NoKeyLost. The source row is deleted without joining it into the survivor.
MODULE: MergeDropsKey
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a merge drops a key acknowledged before the fold
PERTURBS: Merge

--- FIND
Merge(k) ==
    /\ phase = "merging"
    /\ k \in siblingRows
    /\ donorRows' = donorRows \cup {k}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: discard the source key.
Merge(k) ==
    /\ phase = "merging"
    /\ k \in siblingRows
    /\ donorRows' = donorRows
--- END
